## Quarterly Roadmap

{chr(10).join(f'### {quarter["name"]}: {quarter["focus"]}{chr(10)}**Key Features:**{chr(10)}" + chr(10).join(f"- {f['name'].replace('_', ' ')}" for f in quarter["features"]) + chr(10)) for quarter in quarters)}

## Key Initiatives

